-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",362,{
[11553]="70043DF0\n1\tDefeat enemy guards on the Ornendil Bridge (total: 10)\tThe Ornendil Bridge is located in Northern Osgiliath over the Anduin River. You should defeat enemy guards on the Ornendil Bridge.\n2\tSpeak with Edenos\tEdenos is at the Palace of Eldacar. You should speak to Edenos.\n",
[11554]="70002C67\n1\tShow the Orc-brewed sleeping draught to Captain Trotter\tCaptain Trotter can be found in Trestlebridge. Talbot Hinton asked you to show Captain Trotter the strange potion brewed by the Orcs near Nan Wathren.\n2\tFree Talbot Hinton from the stocks\tTalbot Hinton is in the stocks in Trestlebridge. You should free Talbot Hinton from his bonds, for his innocence is proven.\n3\tSpeak with Talbot Hinton\tTalbot Hinton is in Trestlebridge. You should speak with Talbot Hinton.\n4\tReturn to Captain Trotter\tCaptain Trotter can be found in Trestlebridge. You should speak with Captain Trotter once more.\n",
[11555]="70049560\n1\tSpeak with Akhrûn\tAkhrûn can be found near Naerband in Talath Úrui. You should speak with Akhrûn.\n2\tSpeak with Akhrûn\tAkhrûn can be found near Naerband in Talath Úrui. You should speak with Akhrûn.\n3\tDefeat Ghâsh-hai patrollers (total: 8)\tGhâsh-hai patrollers can be found in Talath Úrui near Naerband. You should defeat Ghâsh-hai who patrol the path to Naerband.\n4\tTalk to Akhrûn\tAkhrûn can be found just outside of Orodir, next to Naerband. You should speak with Akhrûn.\n",
[11556]="70066008\n1\tTalk to Celudir\030Talk to Brithben\030Talk to Gloril\030Talk to Ríaneth\030Talk to Nennion\tFingaer has asked you to speak with soldiers in the Keep of the Swan-knights. The Keep of the Swan-knights is in Dol Amroth.\n2\tReturn to Fingaer\tYou have listened to many stories from the soldiers in the Swan-knight's Keep. You should bring these stories to Fingaer who is waiting for you in Harper's Court.\n",
[11557]="70046C2E\n1\tTalk to Thai-chât\030Talk to Daugha-tûm\tThe Haradrim prisoners can be found at Aelin Veren in central North Ithilien. After questioning Jubuya, he has asked you to speak to his fellows about their lives in Harad.\n2\tTalk to Jubuya\tJubuya can be found at Aelin Veren in central North Ithilien. You have spoken to the other prisoners and should now speak to Jubuya once more.\n",
[11558]="70047BEC\n1\tBands of soldiers, Rangers, and warriors can be found throughout Haerondir. Elladan has asked you to gather the soldiers of the Host of the West stationed in Haerondir in the hope that he and his brother might ease their worries through the telling of an old victory over the Enemy.\t\n2\tTalk to Elladan at Haerondir\tElladan can be found on the eastern ramparts of Haerondir. You have gathered many soldiers, rangers, and warriors and should now return to Elladan and Elrohir.\n",
[11559]="7004CE8F\n1\tYou should talk to refugees of Dorwinion and the Chayasír in their camps in the hills to the east of Dale.\t\n2\tReturn to Enkárvo\tYou should return to Enkárvo in the Dorwinion refugee camp, in the hills east of Dale.\n3\tDefeat Tungváka\030Defeat wolves (total: 7)\tThe wolves can be found south and east of the refugee camp hills. You should find and defeat wolf pack leader Tungváka, and a number of his pack, to stop them from being bold enough to attack the Easterling refugees.\n4\tReturn to Enkárvo\tYou should return to Enkárvo in the Dorwinion refugee camp, in the hills east of Dale.\n",
[11560]="700193BF\n1\tPrepare to defend Talan Revail\tCúvroval is at Talan Revail. A flock of crebain is descending upon Talan Revail from the West. Cúvroval has asked you to help defend the talan and drive the crows off!\n2\tTalk to Cúvroval at Talan Revail\tCúvroval is at Talan Revail. You should speak with Cúvroval regarding the craban-attack on Talan Revail.\n",
[11561]="70027B77\n1\tDefeat Falcon-clan warriors in Tâl Methedras (total: 12)\tWarriors of the Falcon-clan can be found throughout Tûr Morva, in Tâl Methedras.\n2\tTalk to Théodred at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras\tThéodred is at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras. You have defeated many Falcon-clan warriors and should return to Théodred at the forward encampment.\n",
[11562]="7005973B\n1\tDestroy stenchwort (total: 10)\030Destroy bittercreep vines (total: 8)\030Destroy wilderyew saplings (total: 10)\tBittercreep, stenchwort, and wilderyew saplings can be found in the northern Wildwood. Thornmane has asked you to deal with some botanical issues in the Wildwood.\n2\tTalk to Thornmane\tThornmane is in the central Wildwood. You should talk to Thornmane.\n",
[11563]="7003520B\n1\tDefeat black roots (total: 8)\tTwisted roots of the Balewood have risen through the snow near sites of Núrzum's presence to strangle all passers-by. These roots must be cleaved to protect the other trees and Ents of the Balewood.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have hewn many roots of the Balewood and have guarded the nearby trees from Núrzum and the Stone's influence.\n",
[11564]="700033DE\n1\tSpeak with Bersi\tEscort Bersi out of the spider-lair, defending him from the spiders.\n",
[11565]="7000ACEE\n1\tPresent the Tapestry of Deeds to Techeron in Esteldín\030Craft a Tapestry of Deeds (quantity: see journal)\tTecheron is at Esteldín, in the North Downs. Techeron has asked you to weave a tapestry of the deeds of the fallen, which might be used to hearten those who remain.\n",
[11566]="70062F1F\n1\tSpeak with the Tarkrîp emissary\tYou may seek the blessing of the Tarkrîp clan. All you need do is renounce all other clans.\n",
[11567]="7003E2AC\n1\tDefeat raging Tarkrîps (total: 12)\030Defeat Tarkrîp Marksmen (total: 12)\030Defeat Tarkrîp Fight-masters (total: 5)\tRaging Tarkrîps, Tarkrîp Marksmen, and Tarkrîp Fight-masters can be found in central Nan Wathren. You should defeat several of these vicious Orcs in Nan Wathren.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have answered the challenge of the Tarkrîp fighters in central Nan Wathren, besting these terrible foes.\n",
[11568]="7004103C\n1\tDestroy barrels of ale in Tarlang's Crown (total: 6)\tBarrels of ale can be found throughout Tarlang's Crown, especially near Corsair tents. Elaglar has asked you to destroy barrels of ale in Tarlang's Crown in hopes that it will throw the Corsairs into disarray.\n2\tTalk to Elaglar\tElaglar can be found in Dol Amroth. You have destroyed many barrels of Corsair ale, and should report your success to Elaglar.\n",
[11569]="7004103B\n1\tRecover stolen barrels from Tarlang's Crown (total: 8)\tBarrels can be found throughout Tarlang's Crown and the river Blackroot. Elaglar has asked you to recover barrels stolen from Blackroot Vale in Tarlang's Crown.\n2\tDeliver the stolen barrels to Elaglar\tElaglar can be found in Dol Amroth. You have retrieved many stolen barrels from Tarlang's Crown and should deliver them to Elaglar.\n",
[11570]="70041032\n1\tDefeat Corsairs in Tarlang's Crown (total: 10)\tCorsairs can be found throughout Tarlang's Crown. Elaglar has asked you to thin the numbers of the Corsair forces in Tarlang's Crown.\n2\tTalk to Elaglar\tElaglar can be found in Dol Amroth. You have slain many Corsairs and should now report to Elaglar.\n",
[11571]="7004103D\n1\tDefeat darkwater in Tarlang's Crown (total: 6)\tDarkwater can be found in and along the river Blackroot throughout Tarlang's Crown. Elaglar has asked you to venture to Tarlang's Crown and defeat the darkwater under the thrall of the Heirs of Castamir.\n2\tTalk to Elaglar\tElaglar can be found in Dol Amroth. You have defeated darkwater lurking in Tarlang's Crown and should report to Elaglar.\n",
[11572]="70065919\n1\tBring Tokens of Heroism to the hardened traveller\030Collect Tokens of Heroism (total: 10)\tCollect Tokens of Heroism from your battles across Middle-earth.\n",
[11573]="700659C3\n1\tBring Tokens of Heroism to the hardened traveller\030Collect Tokens of Heroism (total: 20)\tCollect Tokens of Heroism from your battles across Middle-earth.\n",
[11574]="700659C4\n1\tBring Tokens of Heroism to the hardened traveller\030Collect Tokens of Heroism (total: 30)\tCollect Tokens of Heroism from your battles across Middle-earth.\n",
[11575]="7005A690\n1\tCollect harthrót (total: 5)\tHalvar has asked you to collect some harthrót plants for him to work with. Harthrót can be found along the road at Tharkh Shathur, south-east of Ashmargathâl.\n2\tTalk to Halvar\tYou have picked some harthrót, and should take the plants back to Halvar in Ashmargathâl.\n",
[11576]="70008875\n1\tReturn to Taskmaster Raulik at Tol Ascarnen\030Collect Elf-ears (total: 6)\tElves can be found within the Ettenmoors. Taskmaster Raulik attempted to communicate that he wishes you to find Elves from which to cultivate their ears... a rare delicacy.\n",
[11577]="7001B5EC\n1\tTalk to Dodder Twofoot at the Taste of Hobbiton\tSpeak with Dodder Twofoot to receive two free tickets to the Taste of Hobbiton.\n",
[11578]="70008756\n1\tDefeat Hoarhallow Farmer (total: 5)\030Defeat Hoarhallow Gardener (total: 5)\tRat-folk with fat round bellies are rumoured to live in a village far south beyond the Steps of Gram. Taskmaster Fikdag wants you to make your way into the southern area of the Ettenmoors in search of rat-folk.\n2\tTalk to Task-master Fikdag\tTaskmaster Fikdag is at Dâr-gazag. You slew the rat-folk with ease and now should return to Taskmaster Fikdag.\n",
[11579]="70008758\n1\tReturn to Dâr-gazag and speak with Taskmaster Fikdag\030Collect hobbit-legs (total: 10)\tHoarhallow lay to the south on the eastern side of the Hoardale River. Taskmaster Fikdag at Dâr-gazag has grown fond of the flesh found on the bones of the rat-folk, and he has asked you to collect some of their legs.\n",
[11580]="7000876E\n1\tReturn the hobbit-feet to Bok in Grothum\030Collect hobbit-feet (total: 6)\tHoarhallow is far to the south-west on the eastern bank of the Hoardale River. Bok waits for you to return to him with the hobbit-feet you were sent to harvest.\n",
[11581]="70057E4E\n1\tBring a sample to Gwárben\030Bring a sample to Arastil\030Bring a sample to Daghir\030Bring a sample to Brandion\030Bring a sample to Pelnen\tGondorian nobles can be found about the city of Minas Tirith. You should find Gondorian nobles to test the tasty morsels.\n2\tReturn to Othnoron\tOthnoron is in Minas Tirith. You should return to Othnoron with the results of the taste testing.\n",
[11582]="70043E09\n1\tGather Slug Goo (total: 10)\tSlugs can be found in Osgiliath. You should collect Slug Goo.\n2\tBring the Slug goo to Dulglok at Shrak Mauruk\tDulglok is at Shrak Mauruk. You should bring the Slug goo to Dulglok.\n",
[11583]="7001ABA0\n1\tDefeat Athgrat\030Defeat Kranklob\tDraugdegil lies north and east of Helethir.\n",
[11584]="7000F494\n1\tTalk to Joy Bloomer\tJoy Bloomer is in Staddle, east of Bree. Henry Oakeshott has asked that you speak with his business partner, Joy Bloomer, and assure her that her shipment will arrive soon.\n",
})
